      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I tested this in a world with a friend, when I left the world they told me the duplicated items didn't disappear with me. Did more experiments, after 50 items per person are spawned/duplicated it shows the spawn box but no new items spawn so here is a limit it isn't infinite.",
