  "details": "Requires two people to see this happen.\n\nRepro: \n\n1. Player one spawns an item.\n\n2. Player one deletes their item.\n\n3. Player one spawns their item again.\n\n4. Player two sees two copies of the item.\n\n5. Repeat for many items.\n\nVideo of this occuring:\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Nu7YywKUiKo",
